WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.160
I think capitalism is great if you want
to do it

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:06.260
but don't make everyone play your stupid game.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.800
I like Fortnite, I don't make your
grandma play

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.080
and take away her house if she loses.

